  rules: [
    "1\uFE0F\u20E3 PRESENT CONTINUOUS KELASI ZAMANDA\n\nPresent Continuous (be + V-ing) kelasi zamonda faqat REJALASHTIRILGAN ish-harakatlar uchun ishlatiladi. Bunda vaqt odatda aniq ko'rsatiladi.\n\nI am meeting my friend tomorrow. (Men ertaga do'stim bilan uchrashyapman — reja)\nShe is flying to New York next week. (U kelasi hafta Nyu-Yorkka uchmoqda)\nWe are having dinner at 8 tonight. (Bugun kechki 8 da ovqatlanamiz)\n\nMUHIM: Bu kelasi zamondagi reja, HOZIR bo'layotgan ish emas!",
    "2\uFE0F\u20E3 QACHON ISHLATILADI?\n\n1. SHAXSIY REJALAR: I am going to the dentist tomorrow.\n2. UCHRASHUVLAR: We are meeting at 6.\n3. SAFARLAR: He is flying to Paris on Friday.\n4. GURUH REJALARI: Our team is having a meeting.\n\nBunda vaqt ko'rsatkichi (tomorrow, next week, tonight) deyarli har doim ishlatiladi. Vaqt bo'lmasa, hozirgi zamon deb tushuniladi.\n  I am reading a book. (hozir)\n  I am reading a book tonight. (reja — kelasi zamon)",
    "3\uFE0F\u20E3 WILL VA PRESENT CONTINUOUS FARQI\n\nPresent Continuous — shaxsiy REJALAR (tayyor):\n  I am meeting John at 6. (Uchrashuv tayinlangan)\n  They are getting married in June. (To'y rejalashtirilgan)\n\nWill — ixtiyoriy taklif, bashorat, reaktsiya:\n  I will help you. (Yordam berishga taklif)\n  I think it will rain. (Bashorat)\n  Wait, I will open the door. (Reaktsiya)\n\nPresent Continuous bilan 'will' o'rnini bosa olmaydi!\n  \u274C I am helping you. (Agar hozir qaror qilgan bo'lsangiz)\n  \u2705 I will help you. (Hozir qaror qildim)",
    "4\uFE0F\u20E3 BE GOING TO VA PRESENT CONTINUOUS FARQI\n\nPresent Continuous — NIQOB aniq reja (vaqt joy ma'lum):\n  I am flying to Dubai on July 10th.\n  We are meeting at 5 pm.\n\nBe going to — NIYAT yoki DALIL:\n  I am going to buy a new car. (Niyat, hali aniq vaqt yo'q)\n  Look at those clouds! It is going to rain. (Dalil asosida bashorat)\n\nBe going to ikki xil ma'noda:\n  1. Niyat: I am going to study abroad.\n  2. Bashorat (dalil bilan): It is going to snow.",
    "5\uFE0F\u20E3 VAQT BELGILARI\n\nKelasi zamon vaqt belgilari Present Continuous bilan:\n  tonight — bugun kechqurun\n  tomorrow — ertaga\n  next week/month/year — kelasi hafta/oy/yil\n  this weekend — shu dam olish\n  on Friday — juma kuni\n  in July — iyulda\n  at 5 o'clock — soat 5 da\n  in two days — ikki kundan keyin\n\nVaqt belgisisiz — hozirgi zamon ma'nosida tushuniladi.",
    "6\uFE0F\u20E3 O'ZGARMAS VAQT JADVALLARI (Present Simple)\n\nPresent Continuous bilan aralashmasin:\n\nPresent Simple — jadvallar, dasturlar, rasmiy vaqtlar:\n  The train leaves at 6 am. (Poyezd jadvali)\n  The shop opens at 9. (Do'kon ish vaqti)\n  When does the film start? (Kino jadvali)\n\nPresent Continuous — shaxsiy rejalar:\n  I am leaving at 6 am. (Mening shaxsiy rejam)\n  We are meeting at 9. (Uchrashuvimiz)",
    "7\uFE0F\u20E3 O'ZBEKCHA XATOLAR\n\n\u2022 I meeting my friend tomorrow \u274C (I am meeting \u2705)\n\u2022 She is go to London \u274C (She is going \u2705)\n\u2022 He is meet us at 6 \u274C (He is meeting \u2705)\n\u2022 I am will go \u274C (I am going / I will go \u2705)\n\u2022 We are going to the cinema, but not sure when \u274C (Going to bilan niyat, aniq vaqt bo'lmasa)\n\u2022 The train is leaving at 5 (poyezd jadvali \u2192 The train leaves at 5 \u2705)",
  ],
